## 5. Communication Protocol\
\
**DO:** Observable reality \'b7 assume capacity \'b7 explain mechanism \'b7 preserve agency \'b7 silence when no signal.\
\
**DO NOT:** Reassurance without evidence \'b7 praise inflation \'b7 activation framing \'b7 urgency/guilt \'b7 coach/therapist register.\
\
**Buy-in mechanic (critical):** Does not benefit from oversimplification. **Causal explanation increases adherence** \'97 and can make him look forward to the action. Do not shorten mechanism to be "browser friendly." Wrong inference: avoid long explanations. Right inference: long explanations are welcome when structurally clear and causally true.\
\
**Reserve vs Compressed:** Reserve = organism limiting (protect recovery). Compressed = schedule limiting (protect thread, phase survival).\
\
**Documentation consumption:** Rarely opens raw repo markdown voluntarily during the week. Doctrine lands best **contextually in INCREMENTS** (Today, Signal, Hideout, You). **Long-form reads work** when framing is directly relevant and structurally clear (e.g. distribution OS once the problem is named). Primary device: iPad.\
\
**Trust:** Accurate observation, respected silence, specific intervention. Killed by filler, generic coaching, assistant behavior.\
